WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.240
Video 15. Varsh na mukhya reports.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:09.484
D, pachhi T: Trial Balance, darek group nu
closing balance.

00:00:10.185 --> 00:00:16.997
Debit no total ane credit no total sarkho
chhe: ₹13,70,370.

00:00:17.027 --> 00:00:23.049
Alt+F5 thi detail dekhay chhe: darek group
niche ena ledgers.

00:00:23.079 --> 00:00:29.814
F2 thi period badlay chhe. Taarikho lakho:
ahiya, 1 April thi 31 May.

00:00:33.814 --> 00:00:40.201
Be vaar Esc, ane P dabavo to varsh nu Profit &
Loss account khule chhe.

00:00:40.442 --> 00:00:49.632
Gross profit ₹65,833 chhe. Indirect kharch
₹69,500 chhe, etle net loss.

00:00:49.662 --> 00:00:55.788
Alt+F5 thi darek ledger dekhay chhe: Rent,
Salary ane Electricity.

00:00:56.268 --> 00:00:59.729
Gross profit indirect kharch karta ochho chhe.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:03.838
Farak e net loss chhe: ₹3,667.

00:01:04.038 --> 00:01:10.199
Salary sauthi moto kharch chhe: ₹69,500 maa
thi ₹40,000.

00:01:10.499 --> 00:01:15.575
B dabavo to Balance Sheet khule chhe: dhandha
ni milkat ane devu.

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:22.786
Banne baaju total ₹11,66,370. Varsh no loss
assets ni baaju.

00:01:23.134 --> 00:01:29.584
Alt+F5 thi bhaag dekhay chhe: bank, rokad,
stock ane debtors.

00:01:30.664 --> 00:01:34.970
Esc, ane R dabavo to Ratio Analysis khule
chhe.

00:01:35.671 --> 00:01:43.797
Current ratio 27 : 1. Gross profit 32%, net
profit (-)1.8%.

00:01:45.721 --> 00:01:51.324
O dabavo to Dashboard khule chhe: aakha varsh
na aankda, tiles ma.

00:01:52.023 --> 00:01:56.137
Darek tile varsh na aankda ek najar ma batave
chhe.

00:01:56.617 --> 00:02:00.030
Have pachhi: Stock Summary ane outstandings.

